{
    "background_story": "Cataleya was a brilliant engineer with a passion for innovative design. Growing up, she was fascinated by the way things moved and connected. Her fascination with hinges, in particular, led her to create a revolutionary new type of joint that could withstand immense pressure and stress. Cataleya's design, dubbed the 'Eclipse Hinge,' quickly gained attention from industries ranging from aerospace to healthcare. Her invention became a crucial component in everything from spacecraft to prosthetic limbs. As the CEO of her own company, Cataleya continued to push the boundaries of what was possible, using her hinge design as a foundation for even more groundbreaking innovations. She became known as the 'Hinge Whisperer,' and her work transformed the way people lived and worked.",
